  "problems": "The official guide is a single image (images.veromoda.com/p/media/sizeguide_vm.jpg) on veromoda.com/en-gb/sizeguide; values were transcribed visually from the full-resolution image (decimal commas such as 65,5 recorded as 65.5), so a second check is advisable. The image also gives BELOW THE BUST (not recorded). Jeans sizes skip 35 (34 is followed by 36). The jeans table repeats the same inseam (76/81/86) for every waist size, so inseam is a separate chart keyed by length. The XS-XL, EU and UK tables are separate and do not line up exactly (e.g. letter M waist 73 = EU 38 waist 73 = UK 10 waist 73, but EU 40 waist 77 has no letter equivalent); no cross-aliases are published, so none were added."
